{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.99.91.59","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81013,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b4679ef96c8183cd62226de230e733b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello there! I recently got engaged to the love of my life. We&#039;ve been together for almost 15 years now (May 10). Yeah, I know... it took him that long while I patiently waited. But on the other hand, we were both busy with education, career, etc., plus, we are doing everything backwards anyway: got a house, cats. So, it&#039;s more of a formality now. However, all our family and friends are exhilarated and cannot wait for the big day which we haven&#039;t even set yet.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So, I just started to look and I am already overwhelmed. I really want to have a budget friendly, stress free destination wedding with our closest and dearest people. So, now my head spins as to whether to do it in Mexico Playa or Cancun areas or in Dominican republic? What month should we pick? And I probably need a wedding planner\/agent as well.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any suggestions or inputs are greatly appreciated.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1917553,"PostDate":1492030030,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello there! I recently got engaged to the love of my life. We've been together for almost 15 years now (May 10). Yeah, I know... it took him that long while I patiently waited. But on the other hand, we were both busy with education, career, etc., plus, we are doing everything backwards anyway: got a house, cats. So, it's more of a formality now. However, all our family and friends are exhilarated and cannot wait for the big day which we haven't even set yet.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So, I just started to look and I am already overwhelmed. I really want to have a budget friendly, stress free destination wedding with our closest and dearest people. So, now my head spins as to whether to do it in Mexico Playa or Cancun areas or in Dominican republic? What month should we pick? And I probably need a wedding planner\/agent as well.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any suggestions or inputs are greatly appreciated.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sttcty@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.99.91.59","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1492028762,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Inessa","Id":288740,"Name":"Inessa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.95.180.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81013,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c2dfd8d517acae6fc61483f2aaf18e9c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congratulations Inessa and welcome to the BDW forum! You have come to the right place and we are here to help create the destination wedding of your dreams! Just click the link below if you&#039;d like a BDW TA to contact you and help make things as stress free as possible. &amp;nbsp;Please let us know if you have any questions. Thanks! TA Patty&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1917556,"PostDate":1492039777,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congratulations Inessa and welcome to the BDW forum! You have come to the right place and we are here to help create the destination wedding of your dreams! Just click the link below if you'd like a BDW TA to contact you and help make things as stress free as possible. \u00a0Please let us know if you have any questions. Thanks! TA Patty<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency | <\/span><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner | Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"patty@wrighttravelagency.com","IpAddress":"76.95.92.213","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1278635880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230028.jpg?_r=1398727965","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Patty","Id":230028,"Name":"TA Patty","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.187.229.252","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81013,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf3a6ab05d20e90ec20d33f7f2b614ae","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Inessa,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congratulations on your engagement and congratulations on deciding on doing a Destination Wedding! You will find that the you have so many options to select from and if it gets to be a bit overwhelming we here at Wright Travel Agency are ready and able to help in any and every way you may need it!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We specialize in Destination weddings, and know all of the ins and outs of getting the most for your money as well as creating an amazing experience for you and your guests.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Narrowing down your choices of Destination, and selecting the resort that provides you with the perfect fit is where we can be your partner\/advocate\/agent.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Let us know how we can best assist at the moment even if it is just bouncing questions off of us, and giving you information on how the process works!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Best wishes to you in this exciting time!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;TA Wendy&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(164,164,164);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/\" title=\"External link\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HERE.&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(164,164,164);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Awards and recognition: &lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(164,164,164);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(164,164,164);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;AMResorts Master Agent &amp;amp; Top Agency&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(164,164,164);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | AMResorts Master Agent &amp;amp; Top Agency | &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner | Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1917557,"PostDate":1492040430,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Inessa,<\/p>\n<p>Congratulations on your engagement and congratulations on deciding on doing a Destination Wedding! You will find that the you have so many options to select from and if it gets to be a bit overwhelming we here at Wright Travel Agency are ready and able to help in any and every way you may need it!<\/p>\n<p>We specialize in Destination weddings, and know all of the ins and outs of getting the most for your money as well as creating an amazing experience for you and your guests.<\/p>\n<p>Narrowing down your choices of Destination, and selecting the resort that provides you with the perfect fit is where we can be your partner\/advocate\/agent.<\/p>\n<p>Let us know how we can best assist at the moment even if it is just bouncing questions off of us, and giving you information on how the process works!<\/p>\n<p>Best wishes to you in this exciting time!!<\/p>\n<p>TA Wendy<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(164,164,164)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><a href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\"><strong>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(164,164,164)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\"><strong>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(164,164,164)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(164,164,164)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(164,164,164)\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency | <\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner | Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"wendyhicks1@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"99.187.229.252","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1238012640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216154.jpg?_r=1419958783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Wendy","Id":216154,"Name":"TA Wendy","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
