> Time: 1492667785 / Thu, 20 Apr 2017 05:56:25 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=80218&SessionId=1f9ae2f942b037b8b447a8b9ab780238
> User Msing (288394)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.234.202","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80218,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"ce17804ac6ae41f5793fe18c5193ee37","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;HEY BRIDES TO BE!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I used this forum so much for help that I wanted to contribute my review!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wedding: 6\/25\/2016 at 4pm at the San Jose Gazebo&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Reception: Steakhouse&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Dancing: Club- La Pacha&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I planned my wedding a year out and the most troubling part for a destination bride is not being able to see the venue and it tends to be a slow-paced communication with the RIU wedding coordinator, especially if you are asking questions far out.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wedding Coordinator: &lt;\/strong&gt;My wedding coordinator was Lupita(Guadelupe). She was slow to respond initially, however, as the wedding neared and was about 2 months away, she was very responsive. She responded almost immediately or at least within a day. We met with Guadelupe on Wednesday and our wedding was on Saturday. This meeting was to make payment, go over details, give any decorations, and make any last minute changes. We had a BIG change to make unfortunately. We had to make changes to our reception due to money being stolen out of our room in Mexico City on an overnight layover-ALOT OF MONEY! Lupita was very understanding and helped us make changes to fit our newfound budget. She looks at all the decorations and writes down where you want everything. She will also show you the location at this time if you would like to see it. I had purple and turquoise chair sashes and linen napkins for dinner and she liked them so much she had the hotel buy them from me. So if you are an upcoming bride, they now have 2 new colors of chair sashes and napkins for your use. :-) Overall, Lupita was absolutely amazing. On our wedding day she delivered my flowers to my room at around 12 or 1. Then she came back and got the bridesmaids at 3:30. The rest of my guests were told to be seated at 3:30 as well. She also had previously directed my groom and groomsmen where to meet. She later came and got me and my dad from my room about 15 mins before 4. I stayed in room 3030, which was on the complete opposite side of the resort. So it was quite a walk. We arrived right on time as the bridesman\/groomsmen were completing their walk. They have this timed to a science. It was perfect. The music was played perfect for the ceremony. Everything was seamless.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flowers:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;You are given a checklist for flowers when your wedding coordinator reaches out to you. Luckily, thanks to this website, I had all the checklists ahead of time so I could look over and get an idea for what I wanted. The flower info is below. Alina was amazing. She reached out to me about a month or so before the wedding to finalize the bouquet etc. I sent her 3 pictures of the bouquet I desired. I wanted a cascading bouquet. She sent me back 2 options:one that was included in my package and one that was not. I picked the one included, because it was pretty much exactly what I was looking for and it helped that it was included. My flowers were delivered on time and they were fresh and perfect. Everyone loved them. I LOVED my flowers. They were so perfect that people could not believe they were real! This is the flower company the RIU uses and I do not think you could use anyone else, but I wouldn&#039;t have wanted to. They were amazing! Her info is below.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(204,0,153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;bradley hand itc&#039;;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:13pt;\"&gt;Of:(624)&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;143 40 88&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(204,0,153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;bradley hand itc&#039;;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:13pt;\"&gt;\t  (624)&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;143 20 31&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(204,0,153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;bradley hand itc&#039;;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:13pt;\"&gt;Cel: 624 164 62 96&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(204,0,153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;bradley hand itc&#039;;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:13pt;\"&gt;Nextel:&amp;nbsp; 20409 61  &lt;strong&gt;ID:32*15*24295&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(204,0,153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;bradley hand itc&#039;;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:13pt;\"&gt;USA\/Vonage #:  &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a&gt;(281) 712-1942&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(204,0,153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;bradley hand itc&#039;;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:13pt;\"&gt;Carranza esq. Fco. Villa s\/n col. Centro&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(204,0,153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;bradley hand itc&#039;;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:13pt;\"&gt;Los Cabos Baja California Sur M\u00e8xico&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(46,116,181);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;bradley hand itc&#039;;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:17pt;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bajaflowers.com.mx\/&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(46,116,181);\"&gt;www.bajaflower.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(204,0,153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;bradley hand itc&#039;;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18pt;\"&gt;Alina Gomez&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minister\/Officiant:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;The officiant was&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reverend Marco Arechiga&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;. He emailed me about a month away and gave me different options for how I would like my ceremony to go. He gave the option for religious, non-religious, romantic, humor allowed, etc. He was on time and had an amazing personality. He had some humor and &amp;nbsp;he kept it short and sweet. It was almost 100 degrees, the hottest day during our whole stay the day we got married, so we appreciated the ceremony being short and sweet and I am sure my guests did as well. He is highly recommended. I attached his info below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n\t&lt;div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;\"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:17px;\"&gt;Rev. Marco Arechiga&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/b&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n\t&lt;div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:12.8px;font-family:Helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;\n\t&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Cambria;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"&gt;Wedding Minister&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n\t&lt;div&gt;\n\t&lt;div style=\"margin:0in 0in .0001pt;font-family:Cambria;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Arial;color:#808080;\"&gt;t:&lt;span&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Arial;color:#0000FF;\"&gt;&lt;a&gt;011 52 (624) 173.0005&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n\t&lt;div style=\"margin:0in 0in .0001pt;font-family:Cambria;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Arial;color:#808080;\"&gt;c:&lt;span&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Arial;color:#0000FF;\"&gt;&lt;a&gt;011 52 (624) 122.5090&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n\t&lt;div style=\"margin:0in 0in .0001pt;font-family:Cambria;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Arial;color:#808080;\"&gt;m: &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:marco.arechiga@[member=\"gmail\"].com&#039;&gt;&lt;span&gt;marco.arechiga@[member=\"gmail\"].com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n\t&lt;div style=\"margin:0in 0in .0001pt;font-family:Cambria;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Arial;color:#808080;\"&gt;w:&lt;span&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Arial;color:#0000FF;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.marcoarechiga.com\/&#039;&gt;www.marcoarechiga.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n\t&lt;div style=\"margin:0in 0in .0001pt;font-family:Cambria;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n\t&lt;div style=\"margin:0in 0in .0001pt;font-family:Cambria;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Arial;color:#0000FF;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/pages\/Reverend-Marco-Arechiga\/590060547685159&#039;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Facebook&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;  &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Arial;color:rgb(255,102,0);\"&gt;~&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/b&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Arial;color:#0000FF;\"&gt;  &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/twitter.com\/marcoarechiga&#039;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Twitter&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;  &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Arial;color:rgb(255,102,0);\"&gt;~&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/b&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Arial;color:#0000FF;\"&gt;  &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/vimeo.com\/marcoarechiga&#039;&gt;Vimeo&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n\t&lt;\/div&gt;\n\t&lt;\/div&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resort:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;Resort was amazing. It exceeded all expectations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Rooms: I stayed in room 3030 the Jacuzzi Oceanview suite. We&amp;nbsp;had a double balcony with a jacuzzi up a set of spiral staircase on the roof. It has to be the BEST ROOM IN THE RESORT! The view is insane, the room is huge and it was perfect for my bridesmaids to get ready in our room.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;All of my guests loved their rooms as well. Not one of my 50 guests had a complaint.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Checkin- They set up a private checkin for my 50 guests. Everything went smooth and they set us up all on one side of the resort. Not right next door but in the general vicinity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Food: My biggest fear was bad food. This was not the case. The food was not just ok it was good! Lobster, steak, great buffet. It was all I could ask for. Drinks were sometimes watered down. But not all the time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The resort was more than I could ask for. Beautiful grounds, the staff cleaned around the clock, the food was great, my guests had a ball! This was way better spending the money for a week than just &amp;nbsp;a few hours for 1 day with a traditional wedding. We got the wedding of our dreams, our guests got to share that and got a vacation, it was like an awesome fam reunion, and our families got to spend time together. It was awesome!&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;More pics&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":36289,"Name":"-cabo-wedding113 - Copy.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-65875500-1469719747.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-65875500-1469719747_thumb.jpg","Width":458,"Height":687},{"Id":36290,"Name":"-cabo-wedding120.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-05871600-1469719749.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-05871600-1469719749_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":36291,"Name":"-cabo-wedding123 - Copy.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-33711700-1469719751.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-33711700-1469719751_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":36292,"Name":"-cabo-wedding124 - Copy.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-46891200-1469719752.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-46891200-1469719752_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":436},{"Id":36293,"Name":"-cabo-wedding125 - Copy.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-72882800-1469719753.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-72882800-1469719753_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":36294,"Name":"-cabo-wedding127.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-23713700-1469719755.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-23713700-1469719755_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":36295,"Name":"-cabo-wedding129.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-27838800-1469719757.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-27838800-1469719757_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":461},{"Id":36296,"Name":"-cabo-wedding130 - Copy.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-53859700-1469719758.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-53859700-1469719758_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":36297,"Name":"-cabo-wedding131 - Copy.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-53620800-1469719759.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-53620800-1469719759_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":641},{"Id":36298,"Name":"-cabo-wedding137 - Copy.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-41596200-1469719760.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-41596200-1469719760_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":671},{"Id":36299,"Name":"-cabo-wedding138.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-95809000-1469720399.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-95809000-1469720399_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":614},{"Id":36300,"Name":"-cabo-wedding139.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-92180300-1469720400.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-92180300-1469720400_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":36301,"Name":"-cabo-wedding140.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-13234400-1469720402.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-13234400-1469720402_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":36302,"Name":"-cabo-wedding145.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-40198500-1469720403.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-40198500-1469720403_thumb.jpg","Width":458,"Height":687},{"Id":36303,"Name":"-cabo-wedding146.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-58207300-1469720404.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-58207300-1469720404_thumb.jpg","Width":803,"Height":687},{"Id":36304,"Name":"-cabo-wedding147.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-78240500-1469720405.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-78240500-1469720405_thumb.jpg","Width":458,"Height":687},{"Id":36305,"Name":"-cabo-wedding149.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-61771200-1469720406.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-61771200-1469720406_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":36306,"Name":"-cabo-wedding153.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-58231200-1469720407.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-284112-0-58231200-1469720407_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667}],"Id":1915071,"PostDate":1469698814,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>HEY BRIDES TO BE!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I used this forum so much for help that I wanted to contribute my review!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding: 6\/25\/2016 at 4pm at the San Jose Gazebo<\/p>\n<p>Reception: Steakhouse<\/p>\n<p>Dancing: Club- La Pacha<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I planned my wedding a year out and the most troubling part for a destination bride is not being able to see the venue and it tends to be a slow-paced communication with the RIU wedding coordinator, especially if you are asking questions far out.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Wedding Coordinator: <\/strong>My wedding coordinator was Lupita(Guadelupe). She was slow to respond initially, however, as the wedding neared and was about 2 months away, she was very responsive. She responded almost immediately or at least within a day. We met with Guadelupe on Wednesday and our wedding was on Saturday. This meeting was to make payment, go over details, give any decorations, and make any last minute changes. We had a BIG change to make unfortunately. We had to make changes to our reception due to money being stolen out of our room in Mexico City on an overnight layover-ALOT OF MONEY! Lupita was very understanding and helped us make changes to fit our newfound budget. She looks at all the decorations and writes down where you want everything. She will also show you the location at this time if you would like to see it. I had purple and turquoise chair sashes and linen napkins for dinner and she liked them so much she had the hotel buy them from me. So if you are an upcoming bride, they now have 2 new colors of chair sashes and napkins for your use. :-) Overall, Lupita was absolutely amazing. On our wedding day she delivered my flowers to my room at around 12 or 1. Then she came back and got the bridesmaids at 3:30. The rest of my guests were told to be seated at 3:30 as well. She also had previously directed my groom and groomsmen where to meet. She later came and got me and my dad from my room about 15 mins before 4. I stayed in room 3030, which was on the complete opposite side of the resort. So it was quite a walk. We arrived right on time as the bridesman\/groomsmen were completing their walk. They have this timed to a science. It was perfect. The music was played perfect for the ceremony. Everything was seamless.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Flowers:\u00a0<\/strong>You are given a checklist for flowers when your wedding coordinator reaches out to you. Luckily, thanks to this website, I had all the checklists ahead of time so I could look over and get an idea for what I wanted. The flower info is below. Alina was amazing. She reached out to me about a month or so before the wedding to finalize the bouquet etc. I sent her 3 pictures of the bouquet I desired. I wanted a cascading bouquet. She sent me back 2 options:one that was included in my package and one that was not. I picked the one included, because it was pretty much exactly what I was looking for and it helped that it was included. My flowers were delivered on time and they were fresh and perfect. Everyone loved them. I LOVED my flowers. They were so perfect that people could not believe they were real! This is the flower company the RIU uses and I do not think you could use anyone else, but I wouldn't have wanted to. They were amazing! Her info is below.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(204,0,153)\"><span  style=\"font-family:'bradley hand itc';\"><span  style=\"font-size:13pt\">Of:(624)\u00a0<strong>143 40 88<\/strong>\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(204,0,153)\"><span  style=\"font-family:'bradley hand itc';\"><span  style=\"font-size:13pt\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0(624)\u00a0<strong>143 20 31<\/strong>\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(204,0,153)\"><span  style=\"font-family:'bradley hand itc';\"><span  style=\"font-size:13pt\">Cel: 624 164 62 96<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(204,0,153)\"><span  style=\"font-family:'bradley hand itc';\"><span  style=\"font-size:13pt\">Nextel:\u00a0 20409 61\u00a0\u00a0<strong>ID:32*15*24295<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(204,0,153)\"><span  style=\"font-family:'bradley hand itc';\"><span  style=\"font-size:13pt\">USA\/Vonage #:\u00a0\u00a0<strong><a>(281) 712-1942<\/a><\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(204,0,153)\"><span  style=\"font-family:'bradley hand itc';\"><span  style=\"font-size:13pt\">Carranza esq. Fco. Villa s\/n col. Centro<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(204,0,153)\"><span  style=\"font-family:'bradley hand itc';\"><span  style=\"font-size:13pt\">Los Cabos Baja California Sur M\u00e8xico<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(46,116,181)\"><span  style=\"font-family:'bradley hand itc';\"><span  style=\"font-size:17pt\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bajaflowers.com.mx\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:rgb(46,116,181)\">www.bajaflower.com<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em><span  style=\"color:rgb(204,0,153)\"><span  style=\"font-family:'bradley hand itc';\"><span  style=\"font-size:18pt\">Alina Gomez<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Minister\/Officiant:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span>The officiant was\u00a0<strong><strong>Reverend Marco Arechiga<\/strong><\/strong>. He emailed me about a month away and gave me different options for how I would like my ceremony to go. He gave the option for religious, non-religious, romantic, humor allowed, etc. He was on time and had an amazing personality. He had some humor and \u00a0he kept it short and sweet. It was almost 100 degrees, the hottest day during our whole stay the day we got married, so we appreciated the ceremony being short and sweet and I am sure my guests did as well. He is highly recommended. I attached his info below.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\t<div  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><b><span  style=\"font-size:17px\">Rev. Marco Arechiga<\/span><span  style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:16px;font-weight:normal\">\u00a0<\/span><\/b><\/div>\n\t<div  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:12.8px;font-family:Helvetica, sans-serif\">\n\t<div><span  style=\"font-family:Cambria\"><span  style=\"font-family:Arial\">Wedding Minister<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\t<div>\n\t<div  style=\"margin:0in 0in .0001pt;font-family:Cambria\"><span  style=\"font-family:Arial;color:#808080\">t:<span> <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-family:Arial;color:#0000FF\"><a>011 52 (624) 173.0005<\/a><\/span><\/div>\n\t<div  style=\"margin:0in 0in .0001pt;font-family:Cambria\"><span  style=\"font-family:Arial;color:#808080\">c:<span> <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-family:Arial;color:#0000FF\"><a>011 52 (624) 122.5090<\/a><\/span><\/div>\n\t<div  style=\"margin:0in 0in .0001pt;font-family:Cambria\"><span  style=\"font-family:Arial;color:#808080\">m: \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"font-family:Arial\"><a href='mailto:marco.arechiga@<a hovercard-ref=' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com'><span>marco.arechiga@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/div>\n\t<div  style=\"margin:0in 0in .0001pt;font-family:Cambria\"><span  style=\"font-family:Arial;color:#808080\">w:<span> <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-family:Arial;color:#0000FF\"><a href='http:\/\/www.marcoarechiga.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.marcoarechiga.com<\/a><\/span><\/div>\n\t<div  style=\"margin:0in 0in .0001pt;font-family:Cambria\">\u00a0<\/div>\n\t<div  style=\"margin:0in 0in .0001pt;font-family:Cambria\"><span  style=\"font-family:Arial;color:#0000FF\"><a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/pages\/Reverend-Marco-Arechiga\/590060547685159' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span>Facebook<\/span><\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><b><span  style=\"font-family:Arial;color:rgb(255,102,0)\">~<\/span><\/b><span  style=\"font-family:Arial;color:#0000FF\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href='https:\/\/twitter.com\/marcoarechiga' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span>Twitter<\/span><\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><b><span  style=\"font-family:Arial;color:rgb(255,102,0)\">~<\/span><\/b><span  style=\"font-family:Arial;color:#0000FF\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href='https:\/\/vimeo.com\/marcoarechiga' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Vimeo<\/a><\/span><\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n<br \/><p><strong>Resort:\u00a0<\/strong>Resort was amazing. It exceeded all expectations.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Rooms: I stayed in room 3030 the Jacuzzi Oceanview suite. We\u00a0had a double balcony with a jacuzzi up a set of spiral staircase on the roof. It has to be the BEST ROOM IN THE RESORT! The view is insane, the room is huge and it was perfect for my bridesmaids to get ready in our room.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>All of my guests loved their rooms as well. Not one of my 50 guests had a complaint.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Checkin- They set up a private checkin for my 50 guests. Everything went smooth and they set us up all on one side of the resort. Not right next door but in the general vicinity.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Food: My biggest fear was bad food. This was not the case. The food was not just ok it was good! Lobster, steak, great buffet. It was all I could ask for. Drinks were sometimes watered down. But not all the time.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The resort was more than I could ask for. Beautiful grounds, the staff cleaned around the clock, the food was great, my guests had a ball! This was way better spending the money for a week than just \u00a0a few hours for 1 day with a traditional wedding. We got the wedding of our dreams, our guests got to share that and got a vacation, it was like an awesome fam reunion, and our families got to spend time together. It was awesome!<\/p>\n<br \/><p>More pics<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ana.avant87@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.35.67.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437716537,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284112.jpg?_r=1437784941","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":258,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CaboBride6252016","Id":284112,"Name":"CaboBride6252016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.21.99.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80218,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"013216215063150e345723f8544cafea","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you so much for sharing all of this! Who was your photographer? Your pics are absolutely gorgeous! Congratulations!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915083,"PostDate":1469751102,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you so much for sharing all of this! Who was your photographer? Your pics are absolutely gorgeous! Congratulations!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"thecoolestsarah@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.21.99.76","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1469750146,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287476.jpg?_r=1470978087","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"thecoolestsarah","Id":287476,"Name":"thecoolestsarah","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.153.140.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80218,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0ea77dc032f67aab309b767921000b0f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"CaboBride6252016\"] congratulations on your recent wedding and thank you so much for sharing such wonderful information.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Your photos look absolutely beautiful!!!! &amp;lt;3 I especially love the ones during your newlywed photo session inside with the yellow walls and marble floors. Incredible!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915088,"PostDate":1469772381,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284112\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/284112-cabobride6252016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">CaboBride6252016<\/span><\/a> congratulations on your recent wedding and thank you so much for sharing such wonderful information.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Your photos look absolutely beautiful!!!! <3 I especially love the ones during your newlywed photo session inside with the yellow walls and marble floors. Incredible!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Jasmin & Matt - Breathtaking Destination Wedding & Lifestyle Photography<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\">\u00a0rating on <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/reviews'>Facebook<\/a> & <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21784-jasmin-matt-photography\/'>BestDestinationWedding.com<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Still not convinced? Read our <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/info\/testimonials\/'>testimonials of appreciation from previous couples <3<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>Website:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/'>http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Email:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:info@jasminandmatt.com'>info@jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Phone:<\/strong>\u00a0<a><span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\">+52-1-984-114-3386<\/span><\/a><br><strong>Facebook:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/'>Jasmin & Matt Photography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Instagram:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/jasminandmattphotography\/'>@jasminandmattphotography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Pinterest:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/jasminandmatt'>Jasmin & Matt<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Ask us how we can help you plan your perfect wedding day.<\/span><\/span>","Email":"forward@jasminandmatt.com","IpAddress":"187.153.21.84","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1464774339,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JasminMattPhoto","Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.237.191.7","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80218,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c22196261235637fde6a84a78a196aa","RawContent":"@[member=\"thecoolestsarah\"] omg...I wrote a section  about the photographer but somehow it must have gotten erased.\n\n\nPhotographer was Gilda Badillo. She was insanely amazing. Her and her assistant were warm, friendly, caring, funny, attentive, and professional. They put together a plan from beginning to end the day before as to how the photo order would go. They even went over family dynamics like divorced parents etc to avoid potential conflict. They covered all basis!! These are just from my highlight reel which I got 2 weeks from the wedding..I&#039;m dying to see the rest which I should get soon... thankso so much!!! It was a dream\n@[member=\"JasminMattPhoto\"] thank you!! Yes that is one of my faves!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1915134,"PostDate":1470172474,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287476\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287476-thecoolestsarah\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">thecoolestsarah<\/span><\/a> omg...I wrote a section  about the photographer but somehow it must have gotten erased.<br><br>\nPhotographer was Gilda Badillo. She was insanely amazing. Her and her assistant were warm, friendly, caring, funny, attentive, and professional. They put together a plan from beginning to end the day before as to how the photo order would go. They even went over family dynamics like divorced parents etc to avoid potential conflict. They covered all basis!! These are just from my highlight reel which I got 2 weeks from the wedding..I'm dying to see the rest which I should get soon... thankso so much!!! It was a dream<br \/>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287055\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287055-jasminmattphoto\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JasminMattPhoto<\/span><\/a> thank you!! Yes that is one of my faves!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ana.avant87@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.35.67.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437716537,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284112.jpg?_r=1437784941","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":258,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CaboBride6252016","Id":284112,"Name":"CaboBride6252016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.99.133","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80218,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"838e56aa985242d5207879fdd179c3d2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@CaboBride6252016&amp;nbsp; Congrats on being a Mexico Mrs! Your photos are stunning, and thanks for posting a review of your wedding. They&#039;re always useful for future brides as they go through the planning.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915137,"PostDate":1470179158,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@CaboBride6252016\u00a0 Congrats on being a Mexico Mrs! Your photos are stunning, and thanks for posting a review of your wedding. They're always useful for future brides as they go through the planning.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;484\/st\/20111020\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/6168\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283437399,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"138.32.235.36","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80218,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"35854a091c5f5e097d3ad898f9b575a9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you so much for this l was just wondering who did you makeup and hair for the wedding? &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915257,"PostDate":1470825209,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you so much for this l was just wondering who did you makeup and hair for the wedding? \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ruvimboz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"138.32.235.36","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1470740613,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"mrsjohnson2017","Id":287531,"Name":"mrsjohnson2017","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.238.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80218,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"21d4b1537b148d7e300d0bb85ec0ca83","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"mrsjohnson2017\"] I had a friend come who was a hairdresser. She is not a makeup artist, but she is good with makeup. She did both for me. I lucked up :-)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"acw271011\"] Thank you so much!!! I sure used the heck out of this forum, only right I contribute!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915332,"PostDate":1471457703,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287531\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287531-mrsjohnson2017\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">mrsjohnson2017<\/span><\/a> I had a friend come who was a hairdresser. She is not a makeup artist, but she is good with makeup. She did both for me. I lucked up :-)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a> Thank you so much!!! I sure used the heck out of this forum, only right I contribute!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ana.avant87@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.35.67.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437716537,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284112.jpg?_r=1437784941","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":258,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CaboBride6252016","Id":284112,"Name":"CaboBride6252016","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":7,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications