  'operation' => 'sendConversation',
  'SessionId' => '1f9ae2f942b037b8b447a8b9ab780238',
  'subject' => 'Wedding at riu palace',
  'messageContent' => 'Hey there, 
I wanted to reach out to you as I loved one of your post where you were very thorough about your special day.
I\'m getting married there in Jan 2018. At the gazebo at 4pm possibly the royal package with about 35-40 guest. 
I just want some of your input. I\'m looking to do a private reception for sure. Crazy how they charge extra for that even and extra for open bar and dinner!! What did you do for the reception. 
Your flowers looked amazing we are also using baja flowers. Did you pay extra for your bridesmaids bouqet as it\'s not included in the wedding package. 
Music: dj vs. Audio system?
Chairs for the ceremony and reception, extra for the chair covers?
Did you have a video grapher?
Open bar or no at reception? 
Lots of questions I know, but hoping you can help out a fellow bride planning her destination wedding!
Thank you, hope to hear from you!',
  'users' => 
  array (
    0 => 'CaboBride6252016',
  ),
  'sessionId' => '1f9ae2f942b037b8b447a8b9ab780238',
)
